<title>UK: Bank of china sets $300 million seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of china sets $300 million seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Bank of China</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	*APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +37.5 BP  PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.80     FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB	 REOFFER    99.80</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/HK    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  0.075     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *US/GB/HK/SI/CN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
